    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通（需同調）</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.o9GQEt4fYw6WjpB0]{死者交談 Speak with Dead}</em>或是<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.xYpJGRI4xcMa41kO]{活化死屍 Animate Dead}</em>。以此施展了法術後，直到次日黎明爲止這套護甲都無法再次被用於施展這兩個法術。<br />這套盔甲會隨着你靈魂的離去而消逝。若你在同調這套護甲期間死亡，這套護甲也將隨之摧毀。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>由一件皮外套和護<span class=\"GramE\">脛</span>（可能附有護裙）組合而成，其防護部分由相疊的鐵片覆蓋，結構有如魚的鱗片。<span class=\"GramE\">此護甲同時</span>還附有護手。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can use it to cast either @spell[Speak with Dead] or @spell[Animate Dead]. Once the armor has cast a spell in this way, it can't cast either spell until the next dawn.</p><p>Your soul keeps this armor together. If you die while you are attuned to the armor, the armor is destroyed.</p><p>This armor consists of a coat and leggings (and perhaps a separate skirt) of leather covered with overlapping pieces of metal, much like the scales of a fish. The suit includes gauntlets.</p></div>",
